sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Core as Core Backend / Go Mock Core
    participant Server as Go OpAMP Server adapter
    participant Supervisor as OTel OpAMP Supervisor
    participant Agent as AR-IMMS Agent
    participant Collector as OTel Collector
    Admin->>Core: Publish targeted versioned policy (proposed)
    Supervisor->>Server: Native OpAMP session
    Server->>Core: Authenticate, bind identity, fetch desired policy
    Core-->>Server: Typed policy snapshot + revision (contract pending)
    Server-->>Supervisor: Native RemoteConfig
    Supervisor->>Collector: Compose configured local + remote config; restart
    Collector-->>Supervisor: Runtime health/config evidence
    Supervisor-->>Server: Native status/health evidence
    Server->>Core: Report observed status
    Collector-->>Agent: Diagnostic evidence
    alt Valid and healthy (exact status mapping pending)
      Server->>Core: Report supported applied evidence
    else Failure
      Supervisor->>Collector: Roll back if exact version/config enables supported rollback
      Server->>Core: Report failure/recovery evidence
    end
